  "content": "<p><strong>此模組必須同時安裝在伺服器與客戶端！</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aefa4c17209e86cb0c755a49ea5525396ea4a4a7.png\" alt=\"需要 Artifacts 模組\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2865826cbbc8e8acf1c4f684ee87dc701c2704ef_0.webp\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7e3504b963515c17c6c769649bca45f5962a1c01.png\" alt=\"需要 Architectury API\"></a></p><h3>在合成格中組合任意兩個神器：</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/758789d231147e936286f8d8126a4698c8186b57.png\" alt=\"合成兩個神器以獲得隨機神器\"></p><h3>此模組的目的：</h3><p><em>透過獲得隨機神器來處理重複或不想要的神器。</em> </p><h3>使用方法：</h3><p><em>只需將兩個神器一起合成，即可將它們轉化為一個新的隨機神器！</em></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fneuromuser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e0a17c08955f755a165b38af1ac6351cb2740209.png\" alt=\"在 Ko-Fi 上支持我\"></a></p>",
